guarantee: AC-6: WavTrackSource applies a drift factor to the synthetic stamps
file: crates/voicen-core/src/call/wav_source.rs
added_by: task-validator round 1
test: cargo test -p voicen-core call::wav_source
--- old
            / (f64::from(self.rate) * (1.0 + self.drift).max(1e-9));
--- new
            / (f64::from(self.rate) * (1.0 - self.drift).max(1e-9));
--- end
